  "notes": [
    "Status: draft written by an agent from corpus/notes/test_drawing_1.md and the content stream (T0.10). Not yet reviewed by the owner.",
    "Regions: union of the font boxes of the text objects of each callout. Horizontal extent from the glyph advance widths (/W of the CID font) without leading or trailing spaces, vertical extent from font ascent to descent (/FontDescriptor). Positions from Tm, Tf and the page CTM, computed with a local Python script using pypdf 6.14.2, rounded to 0.01 pt. All text on this sheet is horizontal, so every angle is 0.",
    "Not characteristics: zone labels, title block labels and empty fields, UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED / DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETERS, the empty ANGULAR = ± ° and SURFACE FINISH fields, DO NOT SCALE DRAWING, THIRD ANGLE PROJECTION, SIZE C, SCALE 1:1, SHEET 1 of 1.",
    "Untoleranced dimensions and the untoleranced angle have no limits and rule no_tolerance_defined: the drawing declares no general tolerance (notes finding 2).",
    "Explicit deviations win over the fit table (notes finding 1): c03 uses the printed +0.0203 / -0 although ISO 286 H7 at 30 mm gives +0.021 / 0, c11 uses the printed -0.0127 / -0.0279.",
